		"• Expenses: Quick entry, AI receipt scanning, spending forecasts.\n• Reports: Interactive charts, month comparisons, budget suggestions, export.\n• Savings: Set financial goals and track monthly deposits.\n• Wealth: Net worth, karat-based gold ledger, debts, emergency runway, zakat.\n• Shopping: Smart market list and convert items to expenses.\n• More: Rotating savings circle (kumala), events planner, sinking funds, key dates.\n• Settings: Private income management, exchange rates, and PIN protection.",
		"• Expenses: Quick entry, AI receipt scanning, spending forecasts.\n• Reports: Interactive charts, month comparisons, budget suggestions, export.\n• Savings: Set financial goals and track monthly deposits.\n• Wealth: Net worth, karat-based gold ledger, debts, emergency runway, zakat.\n• Shopping: Smart market list and convert items to expenses.\n• More: Rotating savings circle (kumala), events planner, sinking funds, key dates.\n• Settings: Private income management, exchange rates, and PIN protection.",
